  "body": "Currently there isn't text in the specification to account for a user intiated URL change in their URL bar.\r\n\r\nCould we consider:\r\n- User visits a page with an opener context\r\n- User changes the URL bar to a different origin\r\n- Opener context is disowned and the new context is a top-level browsing context\r\n- User navigates backwards\r\n- Opener context is attached again and the new context is a auxiliary browsing context\r\n\r\n/cc @bobowen",
